+              "Path ["
+                      + String.join(".", Arrays.copyOfRange(pathElements, 0, index))
+                      + "] has value ["
+                      + currentValue
+                      + "] of type ["
+                      + currentValue.getClass().getSimpleName()
+                      + "], which cannot be traversed into further"
+      );
+    }
+  }
